<title>USA: Wilshire picked to service $250 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Wilshire picked to service $250 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilshire Financial Services Group Inc said Tuesday it had been selected by Solomon Brothers to service a $250 million loan pool.</p>
<p>The loan pool, which was recently purchased by Solomon Brothers from the U.S. Department of Housing &amp; Urban Development, consists of 4,800 performing, single family residence loans, the company said.</p>
<p>Wilshire Financial Services, a diversified financial services company, said with the addition of this contract it now services more than 185,000 loans valued at over $2.5 billion.</p>
</text>
